  <Groups>
    <Group elementId="CPLXQT-15" textLabel="CPLXQT-15" type="Complex">
      <Xref identifier="CPLXQT-15" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="695" width="140" height="100" textColor="666666" fontName="Arial" fontSize="10" borderColor="9900CC" borderStyle="Dashed" borderWidth="2.0" fillColor="F5E6FF" shapeType="Rectangle" zOrder="-1" />
      <Comment>The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; gene &lt;i&gt;NUDT7&lt;/i&gt; encodes a protein belonging to the Nudix hydrolase family |CITS:[16154395]|. The enzyme was expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt; and purified. It was shown to form a dimer and to have ADP-ribose hydroxylase activity |CITS:[16154395]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="CPLXQT-15" />
      <Property key="ComplexComponents" value="AT4G12720-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="ComponentCount" value="1" />
      <Property key="IsComplex" value="true" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33409, RXN-33408, RXN-33407, RXN-9531" />
